{"id":"ffc504ac94bd0528","group":"90","path":"90/90-df-tm-halts.md","title":"Two-Way Machine Halting","display":"df-tm-halts — Two-Way Machine Halting","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-df-tm-halts","aliases":["90-df-tm-halts"],"display":"df-tm-halts — Two-Way Machine Halting","depends_on":["[[90-df-turing-machine]]","[[90-df-relation]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-df-tm-halts"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-df-tm-halts</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-tm-halts — Two-Way Machine Halting"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"82c921b871f2639b\" href=\"?note=82c921b871f2639b\" title=\"90-df-turing-machine\">90-df-turing-machine</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4badec96813b3395\" href=\"?note=4badec96813b3395\" title=\"90-df-relation\">90-df-relation</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\">\\(M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\)</span>；纸带位置为元语言整数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb Z\">\\(\\mathbb Z\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in\\Sigma_M^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(w\\in\\Sigma_M^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>；输入置于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0,\\ldots,|w|-1\">\\(0,\\ldots,|w|-1\\)</span>，其余位置为空白。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\\in Q_M\">\\(q\\in Q_M\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\\in\\mathbb Z\">\\(h\\in\\mathbb Z\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau[h\\mapsto b]\">\\(\\tau[h\\mapsto b]\\)</span> 是以单个位置更新的函数图；有限支持、配置、步关系、有限运行及停机配置都在 Assertion 中定义。与本书原半无限版本用不同的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"88\">\\(88\\)</span> 接口标识。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau,\\tau&#39;\\in\\operatorname{Tape}^{88}_M\">\\(\\tau,\\tau&#39;\\in\\operatorname{Tape}^{88}_M\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\\in\\Gamma_M\">\\(b\\in\\Gamma_M\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\\in\\{\\mathrm L,\\mathrm R\\}\">\\(d\\in\\{\\mathrm L,\\mathrm R\\}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\\in\\mathbb Z\">\\(j\\in\\mathbb Z\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q&#39;\\in Q_M\">\\(q&#39;\\in Q_M\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h&#39;\\in\\mathbb Z\">\\(h&#39;\\in\\mathbb Z\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\\in\\operatorname{Conf}^{88}_M\">\\(c\\in\\operatorname{Conf}^{88}_M\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec c\\in(\\operatorname{Conf}^{88}_M)^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\vec c\\in(\\operatorname{Conf}^{88}_M)^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Tape}^{88}_M&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\tau:\\tau:\\mathbb Z\\to\\Gamma_M\\land\n|\\{j\\in\\mathbb Z:\\tau(j)\\ne B_M\\}|&lt;\\infty\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Conf}^{88}_M&amp;\\coloneqq Q_M\\times\\operatorname{Tape}^{88}_M\\times\\mathbb Z,\\\\\n\\tau[h\\mapsto b]&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(j,\\tau(j)):j\\in\\mathbb Z\\land j\\ne h\\}\\cup\\{(h,b)\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{move}(h,d)&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}h-1,&amp;d=\\mathrm L,\\\\h+1,&amp;d=\\mathrm R,\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\operatorname{Step}^{88}_M((q,\\tau,h),(q&#39;,\\tau&#39;,h&#39;))&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n(q,\\tau,h),(q&#39;,\\tau&#39;,h&#39;)\\in\\operatorname{Conf}^{88}_M\\land q\\notin H_M\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\exists b\\in\\Gamma_M\\ \\exists d\\in\\{\\mathrm L,\\mathrm R\\}\\\n[\\delta_M(q,\\tau(h))=(q&#39;,b,d)\\land\\tau&#39;=\\tau[h\\mapsto b]\\land h&#39;=\\operatorname{move}(h,d)],\\\\\n\\tau_w(j)&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}w_j,&amp;0\\le j&lt;|w|,\\\\B_M,&amp;j&lt;0\\lor j\\ge|w|,\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\operatorname{Init}^{88}_M(w)&amp;\\coloneqq(q_{\\mathrm{start}}^M,\\tau_w,0),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Run}^{88}_M(w,\\vec c)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists r\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists\\vec a\\in(\\operatorname{Conf}^{88}_M)^{r+1}\\\n[\\vec c=\\vec a\\land a_0=\\operatorname{Init}^{88}_M(w)\n\\land\\forall i&lt;r\\ \\operatorname{Step}^{88}_M(a_i,a_{i+1})],\\\\\n\\operatorname{HaltConf}^{88}_M(w,c)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\nc\\in H_M\\times\\operatorname{Tape}^{88}_M\\times\\mathbb Z\\land\n\\exists r\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists\\vec a\\in(\\operatorname{Conf}^{88}_M)^{r+1}\\\n[\\operatorname{Run}^{88}_M(w,\\vec a)\\land c=a_r],\\\\\n\\operatorname{Halts}_M(w)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists c\\in\\operatorname{Conf}^{88}_M\\ \\operatorname{HaltConf}^{88}_M(w,c),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Halts}_M(w)&amp;\\Longrightarrow\\exists!c\\in\\operatorname{Conf}^{88}_M\\ \\operatorname{HaltConf}^{88}_M(w,c).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Tape}^{88}_M&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\tau:\\tau:\\mathbb Z\\to\\Gamma_M\\land\n|\\{j\\in\\mathbb Z:\\tau(j)\\ne B_M\\}|&lt;\\infty\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Conf}^{88}_M&amp;\\coloneqq Q_M\\times\\operatorname{Tape}^{88}_M\\times\\mathbb Z,\\\\\n\\tau[h\\mapsto b]&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(j,\\tau(j)):j\\in\\mathbb Z\\land j\\ne h\\}\\cup\\{(h,b)\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{move}(h,d)&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}h-1,&amp;d=\\mathrm L,\\\\h+1,&amp;d=\\mathrm R,\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\operatorname{Step}^{88}_M((q,\\tau,h),(q&#39;,\\tau&#39;,h&#39;))&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n(q,\\tau,h),(q&#39;,\\tau&#39;,h&#39;)\\in\\operatorname{Conf}^{88}_M\\land q\\notin H_M\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\exists b\\in\\Gamma_M\\ \\exists d\\in\\{\\mathrm L,\\mathrm R\\}\\\n[\\delta_M(q,\\tau(h))=(q&#39;,b,d)\\land\\tau&#39;=\\tau[h\\mapsto b]\\land h&#39;=\\operatorname{move}(h,d)],\\\\\n\\tau_w(j)&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}w_j,&amp;0\\le j&lt;|w|,\\\\B_M,&amp;j&lt;0\\lor j\\ge|w|,\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\operatorname{Init}^{88}_M(w)&amp;\\coloneqq(q_{\\mathrm{start}}^M,\\tau_w,0),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Run}^{88}_M(w,\\vec c)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists r\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists\\vec a\\in(\\operatorname{Conf}^{88}_M)^{r+1}\\\n[\\vec c=\\vec a\\land a_0=\\operatorname{Init}^{88}_M(w)\n\\land\\forall i&lt;r\\ \\operatorname{Step}^{88}_M(a_i,a_{i+1})],\\\\\n\\operatorname{HaltConf}^{88}_M(w,c)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\nc\\in H_M\\times\\operatorname{Tape}^{88}_M\\times\\mathbb Z\\land\n\\exists r\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists\\vec a\\in(\\operatorname{Conf}^{88}_M)^{r+1}\\\n[\\operatorname{Run}^{88}_M(w,\\vec a)\\land c=a_r],\\\\\n\\operatorname{Halts}_M(w)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists c\\in\\operatorname{Conf}^{88}_M\\ \\operatorname{HaltConf}^{88}_M(w,c),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Halts}_M(w)&amp;\\Longrightarrow\\exists!c\\in\\operatorname{Conf}^{88}_M\\ \\operatorname{HaltConf}^{88}_M(w,c).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本文件依据第 90 本实际调用的接口补齐未提供的外部依赖，供本书内部使用；不声称复原未提供的外部原文。 原 Step_M 在位置 0 的左移被夹在 0；这里的 Step_M^{88} 在整数纸带上左移到 -1。两种约定可以模拟，但配置、历史码不能逐项等同。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-turing-machine","status":"resolved","id":"82c921b871f2639b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-turing-machine]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-relation","status":"resolved","id":"4badec96813b3395","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-relation]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M\\in\\mathrm{TM}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb Z","display":false},{"tex":"w\\in\\Sigma_M^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"0,\\ldots,|w|-1","display":false},{"tex":"q\\in Q_M","display":false},{"tex":"h\\in\\mathbb Z","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau[h\\mapsto b]","display":false},{"tex":"88","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau,\\tau'\\in\\operatorname{Tape}^{88}_M","display":false},{"tex":"b\\in\\Gamma_M","display":false},{"tex":"d\\in\\{\\mathrm L,\\mathrm R\\}","display":false},{"tex":"j\\in\\mathbb Z","display":false},{"tex":"q'\\in Q_M","display":false},{"tex":"h'\\in\\mathbb Z","display":false},{"tex":"c\\in\\operatorname{Conf}^{88}_M","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec c\\in(\\operatorname{Conf}^{88}_M)^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Tape}^{88}_M&\\coloneqq\\{\\tau:\\tau:\\mathbb Z\\to\\Gamma_M\\land\n|\\{j\\in\\mathbb Z:\\tau(j)\\ne B_M\\}|<\\infty\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Conf}^{88}_M&\\coloneqq Q_M\\times\\operatorname{Tape}^{88}_M\\times\\mathbb Z,\\\\\n\\tau[h\\mapsto b]&\\coloneqq\\{(j,\\tau(j)):j\\in\\mathbb Z\\land j\\ne h\\}\\cup\\{(h,b)\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{move}(h,d)&\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}h-1,&d=\\mathrm L,\\\\h+1,&d=\\mathrm R,\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\operatorname{Step}^{88}_M((q,\\tau,h),(q',\\tau',h'))&\\Longleftrightarrow\n(q,\\tau,h),(q',\\tau',h')\\in\\operatorname{Conf}^{88}_M\\land q\\notin H_M\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\exists b\\in\\Gamma_M\\ \\exists d\\in\\{\\mathrm L,\\mathrm R\\}\\\n[\\delta_M(q,\\tau(h))=(q',b,d)\\land\\tau'=\\tau[h\\mapsto b]\\land h'=\\operatorname{move}(h,d)],\\\\\n\\tau_w(j)&\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}w_j,&0\\le j<|w|,\\\\B_M,&j<0\\lor j\\ge|w|,\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\operatorname{Init}^{88}_M(w)&\\coloneqq(q_{\\mathrm{start}}^M,\\tau_w,0),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Run}^{88}_M(w,\\vec c)&\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists r\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists\\vec a\\in(\\operatorname{Conf}^{88}_M)^{r+1}\\\n[\\vec c=\\vec a\\land a_0=\\operatorname{Init}^{88}_M(w)\n\\land\\forall i<r\\ \\operatorname{Step}^{88}_M(a_i,a_{i+1})],\\\\\n\\operatorname{HaltConf}^{88}_M(w,c)&\\Longleftrightarrow\nc\\in H_M\\times\\operatorname{Tape}^{88}_M\\times\\mathbb Z\\land\n\\exists r\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists\\vec a\\in(\\operatorname{Conf}^{88}_M)^{r+1}\\\n[\\operatorname{Run}^{88}_M(w,\\vec a)\\land c=a_r],\\\\\n\\operatorname{Halts}_M(w)&\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists c\\in\\operatorname{Conf}^{88}_M\\ \\operatorname{HaltConf}^{88}_M(w,c),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Halts}_M(w)&\\Longrightarrow\\exists!c\\in\\operatorname{Conf}^{88}_M\\ \\operatorname{HaltConf}^{88}_M(w,c).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":2947,"backlinks":[{"id":"4de0ebda11529dc6","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{TM},\\Sigma_M,\\operatorname{Halts}_M,\\operatorname{Output}_M$ 分别见 [[90-df-turing-machine]]、[[90-df-tm-halts]]、[[90-df-tm-output]]。"},{"id":"700b210d964b7299","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"82c921b871f2639b","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"本文件的 $\\mathrm{TM}$ 是有限程序数据的可定义类；类成员式按 $\\operatorname{TMData}$ 展开，不要求任意标签的所有有限机器组成集合。通用双向纸带运行见 [[90-df-tm-halts]]；原 [[90-df-configuration]] 给同一数据类型另配半无限纸带运行语义，二者不默认为同一运行关系。"},{"id":"10ddd9c20c6edffd","anchor":"ref-32","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-df-tm-halts]]"},{"id":"da1a6647840ffca5","anchor":"ref-97","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"| `wordenc`、`worddec` | 带元数前缀的数值元组词编码及像集上的部分逆；空元组的词码是单个位0。 | [[90-df-encoding]] |\n| `AcceptNum`、`EffNum`、`s_{m,n}` | 有效通用求值、覆盖及全递归翻译；s-m-n保留程序索引在先的顺序。 | [[90-df-acceptable-program-numbering]]、[[90-thm-smn]] |\n| `Halts_M`、`Output_M`、`Comp_k^{88}` | 本地通用双向纸带的停机、词输出及数值可计算性；不等同于半无限纸带历史码。 | [[90-df-tm-halts]]、[[90-df-tm-output]]、[[90-df-computable-function]] |\n| 子语言呈示的 `EssUnd_{S,g}(P)` | 对P自身语言中的Ax视图作句子集嵌入，不改P三元组及当前S,g。 | [[90-df-essentially-undecidable]] |"},{"id":"32c1f47762a7f658","anchor":"ref-183","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-df-acceptable-program-numbering.md]]\n[[90-df-atomic-formula.md]]\n[[90-df-base-formula.md]]\n[[90-df-base-free-variable.md]]\n[[90-df-base-godel-numbering.md]]\